ask caregiver(who, "Jamie")

TRUE, 2 answers:

  Answer 1:
    who = "Sam"

    Because caregiver("Sam", "Jamie") is satisfied by:
      caregiver(x, y) if parent(x, y) OR guardian(x, y)
      (using: parent(x, y))

    Variable bindings:
      x = "Sam"
      y = "Jamie"

    Proof:
      parent("Sam", "Jamie") is a fact.

  Answer 2:
    who = "Riley"

    Because caregiver("Riley", "Jamie") is satisfied by:
      caregiver(x, y) if parent(x, y) OR guardian(x, y)
      (using: guardian(x, y))

    Variable bindings:
      x = "Riley"
      y = "Jamie"

    Proof:
      guardian("Riley", "Jamie") is a fact.

ask pet_of_family("Mochi", who)

TRUE, 3 answers:

  Answer 1:
    who = "Sam"

    Because pet_of_family("Mochi", "Sam") is satisfied by:
      pet_of_family(pet, adult) if owns(kid, pet) AND caregiver(adult, kid) OR owns(adult, pet)
      (using: owns(kid, pet) AND caregiver(adult, kid))

    Variable bindings:
      kid = "Jamie"
      pet = "Mochi"
      adult = "Sam"

    Proof:
      owns("Jamie", "Mochi") is a fact.

      caregiver("Sam", "Jamie") is satisfied by:
        caregiver(x, y) if parent(x, y) OR guardian(x, y)
        (using: parent(x, y))

      Variable bindings:
        x = "Sam"
        y = "Jamie"

      Proof:
        parent("Sam", "Jamie") is a fact.

  Answer 2:
    who = "Riley"

    Because pet_of_family("Mochi", "Riley") is satisfied by:
      pet_of_family(pet, adult) if owns(kid, pet) AND caregiver(adult, kid) OR owns(adult, pet)
      (using: owns(kid, pet) AND caregiver(adult, kid))

    Variable bindings:
      kid = "Jamie"
      pet = "Mochi"
      adult = "Riley"

    Proof:
      owns("Jamie", "Mochi") is a fact.

      caregiver("Riley", "Jamie") is satisfied by:
        caregiver(x, y) if parent(x, y) OR guardian(x, y)
        (using: guardian(x, y))

      Variable bindings:
        x = "Riley"
        y = "Jamie"

      Proof:
        guardian("Riley", "Jamie") is a fact.

  Answer 3:
    who = "Jamie"

    Because pet_of_family("Mochi", "Jamie") is satisfied by:
      pet_of_family(pet, adult) if owns(kid, pet) AND caregiver(adult, kid) OR owns(adult, pet)
      (using: owns(adult, pet))

    Variable bindings:
      adult = "Jamie"
      pet = "Mochi"

    Proof:
      owns("Jamie", "Mochi") is a fact.

